  era: "1540\u20131545 \xB7 Section 16 \xB7 Mughal Empire \xB7 1526 \u2013 1857"
  title: Sher Shah Suri
  text: 'Sher Shah Suri, who ruled from 1540 to 1545, built an efficient administration: land measurement, the silver rupiya coin, roadside inns called sarais, and the highway later known as the Grand Trunk Road. Akbar adopted many of his reforms.'
